                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Given $x_1(t)=\\cos(2\\pi t)$ and $x_2(t)=\\sin(2\\pi t+\\pi/6)$, which statement about $x(t)=x_1(t)+x_2(t)$ is correct?",
