                "text": "Given $x_1(t)=3\\cos(2\\pi t-\\pi/4)$ and $x_2(t)=-2\\sin(2\\pi t+\\pi/3)$, which statement about $x(t)=x_1(t)+x_2(t)$ is correct?",
