              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The component periods are $4$ for $\\cos(\\pi t/2)$ and $6$ for $\\sin(\\pi t/3)$. The least common repeating time is $\\operatorname{lcm}(4,6)=12$, so the sum repeats every $12$.",
